[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: SharpUnits capability requirements

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: JP-001
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Base SI dimensions
STATEMENT: SharpUnits shall provide Base SI dimensions within a documented compatibility envelope.
COMMENT: Inventory disposition: Partial: integer and exact rational exponent models implemented; API parity unverified. Historical scope and evidence: docs/java-parity-gap-analysis.md; assertion-level implementation and verification evidence: conformance/tck-closure-ledger.json. This record is not a closure claim.

